                            Problem Solving
                        </h3>

                        <p class="text-body-secondary mb-0">
                            <em>Make the most impact with the smallest wave.</em> I approach
                            every development problem with this goal. I look for solutions
                            that balance user experience, performance, and maintainability,
                            while taking care to ensure that changes are felt by those who
                            benefit and go unnoticed by those who don't.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

