                    <i class="bi bi-person display-6"></i>

                    <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mt-2">
                        Personal Project
                    </h3>

                    <p class="small text-body-secondary mb-0">
                        Started as a way to experiment with new technologies
                        while building a dashboard for my own daily use.
                    </p>
                </div>

