                            The production application uses the same underlying
                            architecture with real persistence and integrations.
                        </p>

                        <ul>
                            <li>Entity Framework Core / SQL Server</li>
                            <li>ASP.NET Identity</li>
                            <li>Google OAuth/Calendar integration</li>
                            <li>Persistent per-user data</li>
                        </ul>

                        <a href="https://github.com/DGilbert23" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-github me-2"></i>
                            View on Github
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
